    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1759010/extras/82f973d304ad1fdaf963a2d88b09e093.poster.avif?t=1733424647\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1759010/extras/82f973d304ad1fdaf963a2d88b09e093.webm?t=1733424647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1759010/extras/82f973d304ad1fdaf963a2d88b09e093.mp4?t=1733424647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Phobos Subhuman is a gripping action-adventure game that blends intense combat, mystery, and horror. Follow the journey of an astronaut's daughter as she unravels the truth behind her father's disappearance in the year 2047, in the futuristic city of Athens. Immerse yourself in this story-rich experience and uncover secrets that will challenge the foundations of modern society.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">2026... </h2>A group of astronauts embarked on the first manned mission to Mars, but something went wrong. They disappeared without a trace on the small moon of Phobos, one of Mars' two satellites. The only witness to their disappearance is the all-powerful A.I. known as G.O.D. (Growth Operations Defence).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">2047... </h2>In a world plagued by war, famine, and radioactivity, the daughter of one of the missing astronauts is determined to uncover the truth behind their disappearance. She will dive deep into the mysteries of the Martian moon and unravel secrets that could change the future of humanity forever.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Highly realistic 3D environments and characters<br></li><li>Immersive, tense and mysterious atmosphere<br></li><li>Brutal hand-to-hand, melee and ranged combat system<br></li><li>Unique plot based on astronomical and historical indications<br></li><li>Variety of both post-apocalyptic and Sci-Fi sceneries<br></li><li>Diverse and challenging enemies with unique abilities<br></li><li>Story-rich experience with unexpected twists and turns</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1759010/extras/4d3bdd4f241358062939a0d817027fd9.poster.avif?t=1733424647\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1759010/extras/4d3bdd4f241358062939a0d817027fd9.webm?t=1733424647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1759010/extras/4d3bdd4f241358062939a0d817027fd9.mp4?t=1733424647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Discover the city of Athens like never before in Phobos Subhuman. Explore a futuristic version of this historical city, complete with urban designs based on reality but with added futuristic elements. Take a tour of the city's slums, abandoned and in ruins, showcasing the poverty of the area.<br><br>Get ready, Phobos Subhuman is launching soon on Kickstarter! Make sure you follow us to stay up-to-date and be a part of this exciting journey. <br><br>Will you dare to challenge powers beyond your skill and your comprehension?",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1759010/extras/82f973d304ad1fdaf963a2d88b09e093.poster.avif?t=1733424647\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1759010/extras/82f973d304ad1fdaf963a2d88b09e093.webm?t=1733424647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1759010/extras/82f973d304ad1fdaf963a2d88b09e093.mp4?t=1733424647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Phobos Subhuman is a gripping action-adventure game that blends intense combat, mystery, and horror. Follow the journey of an astronaut's daughter as she unravels the truth behind her father's disappearance in the year 2047, in the futuristic city of Athens. Immerse yourself in this story-rich experience and uncover secrets that will challenge the foundations of modern society.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">2026... </h2>A group of astronauts embarked on the first manned mission to Mars, but something went wrong. They disappeared without a trace on the small moon of Phobos, one of Mars' two satellites. The only witness to their disappearance is the all-powerful A.I. known as G.O.D. (Growth Operations Defence).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">2047... </h2>In a world plagued by war, famine, and radioactivity, the daughter of one of the missing astronauts is determined to uncover the truth behind their disappearance. She will dive deep into the mysteries of the Martian moon and unravel secrets that could change the future of humanity forever.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Highly realistic 3D environments and characters<br></li><li>Immersive, tense and mysterious atmosphere<br></li><li>Brutal hand-to-hand, melee and ranged combat system<br></li><li>Unique plot based on astronomical and historical indications<br></li><li>Variety of both post-apocalyptic and Sci-Fi sceneries<br></li><li>Diverse and challenging enemies with unique abilities<br></li><li>Story-rich experience with unexpected twists and turns</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1759010/extras/4d3bdd4f241358062939a0d817027fd9.poster.avif?t=1733424647\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1759010/extras/4d3bdd4f241358062939a0d817027fd9.webm?t=1733424647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1759010/extras/4d3bdd4f241358062939a0d817027fd9.mp4?t=1733424647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Discover the city of Athens like never before in Phobos Subhuman. Explore a futuristic version of this historical city, complete with urban designs based on reality but with added futuristic elements. Take a tour of the city's slums, abandoned and in ruins, showcasing the poverty of the area.<br><br>Get ready, Phobos Subhuman is launching soon on Kickstarter! Make sure you follow us to stay up-to-date and be a part of this exciting journey. <br><br>Will you dare to challenge powers beyond your skill and your comprehension?",
